# shape: teaching pages with <tr> written directly under <table> and pages with no <html>/<head>/<body> tags at all
kinds=page,element,contains
@@@ file: src/index.html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<title>no html head body written</title>
<table>
  <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
  <tr><td>c</td></tr>
</table>
<p>last
@@@ file: src/partial.html
<div class="card">
  <h3>a fragment: no doctype, no html tag</h3>
</div>
